- You cannot refuse strictly necessary cookies, but you can block or delete cookies in your browser settings (for example, in Chrome: Settings → Privacy and security → Cookies and other site data). Blocking cookies may affect the operation of some features of the site.
- You can withdraw your consent at any time; withdrawal operates prospectively and does not affect the lawfulness of processing carried out before withdrawal.',
